abstract: "Research software and archived outputs for evaluating query-adaptive hybrid retrieval, including SciFact-trained routing, cross-domain effectiveness, fixed-budget random allocation, controlled latency, and historical protocol-audit artifacts. The archive supports partial reproducibility."
